= Remove administrative and legal obstacles to Kurdish citizens forming and organizing Kurdish associations.

To allow Kurdish citizens to express their opinions without repression, the Interior Ministry will stop shutting down their associations en masse. In accordance with the existing Associations Law, we will allow these organizations to form and flourish.

- @root: Continue.

@public_discussion
title: Lift restrictions on discussing the Kurdish Issue in the public sphere.
new-page: true
choose-if: {! return !AnatolianSocialIssues.reason(Q,"public_discussion"); !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ {! return AnatolianSocialIssues.reason(Q,"public_discussion"); !} +]
on-arrival: {! AnatolianSocialIssues.apply(Q,"public_discussion"); !}

= Lift restrictions on discussing the Kurdish Issue in the public sphere.

Kurdish citizens and intellectuals have long faced unfair lawsuits and accusations of separatism for using terms such as the Kurdish Issue. We will direct the Interior Ministry to handle these cases more fairly and with greater respect for freedom of speech.

- @root: Continue.

