= Grant legal permission for regulated Kurdish printing and publishing activities.

It is currently almost impossible to print and publish in Kurdish. By granting legal permission, we will allow the language to be used in publishing, while retaining state regulation to ensure that publications respect constitutional liberties.

- @root: Continue.

@meetings
title: Ease restrictions on the right to hold meetings and demonstrations.
