= Strengthen protection and oversight against unlawful violence by public officials and security forces.

Unlawful violence and abuse by state security forces have persisted in the East for many years, with particularly grave cases involving the gendarmerie. We will fulfil our responsibility by launching a large-scale effort to investigate and prevent such abuses.

- @root: Continue.

